            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.25.10</h3><ul><li>AI apps can add Not from, Subject doesn't have and Message doesn't have to an existing monitor: the monitor tools now explain those filters.</li><li>If an AI app asks for something this version of Keeploop doesn't know, Keeploop says so instead of ignoring it.</li></ul>]]></description>
